      "text": [
        "264 - وَقَالَ عَلِيٌّ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «نَتْفُ اَلْإِبْطِ يَنْفِي اَلرَّائِحَةَ اَلْمَكْرُوهَةَ وَ هُوَ طَهُورٌ وَ سُنَّةٌ مِمَّا أَمَرَ بِهِ اَلطَّيِّبُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.264 - Imam Ali ibn Abi Talib (as) said:\n\"Removing armpit hair eliminates unpleasant odors and is a means of purification and a practice (Sunnah) that was commanded by the Good and Pure Prophet (sw).\""
        ]
      }
